WEBVTT

00:05:55.656 --> 00:06:01.801
"The dogmas of the quiet past
are inadequate to the stormy present.

00:06:02.761 --> 00:06:06.579
The occasion
is piled high with difficulty,

00:06:06.603 --> 00:06:09.981
and we must rise with the occasion."

00:06:10.552 --> 00:06:11.583
I love that.

00:06:11.607 --> 00:06:13.623
Not rise to it, rise with it.

00:06:15.203 --> 00:06:17.192
"As our case is new,

00:06:17.216 --> 00:06:22.296
so we must think anew and act anew.

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.976
We must disenthrall ourselves,

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.965
and then we shall save our country."

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:31.315
I love that word, "disenthrall."